OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy morning     
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain, falling as     
OL,7,Fsnow for a time over the Pennines,     
OL,8,Fwhere some ice is also possible. It    
OL,9,Fwill become mostly dry in the          
OL,10,Fafternoon, with a few brighter breaks  
OL,11,Fdeveloping later.                      
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening with 
OL,14,Fclear intervals, allowing a touch of   
OL,15,Ffrost to form. Cloud will increase     
OL,16,Ffrom the south overnight though with   
OL,17,Fsome outbreaks of rain developing.     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
